services.eligibility:
Persons with Disability who:
are unable to provide themselves with devices and specialty services due to lack of financial resources;
are with psychological barriers or misconceptions about disability restorative procedures and assistive devices;
have impairment or disability which can improve by medical intervention and assistive devices;
elderly persons who can benefit from medical interventions such as: surgery (e.g., cataract extraction) or use of wheelchairs
